## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `HyperNixConfig()`

HyperNix model shape. Same layout as v1, parametric in every axis.

### `HyperNixModel(cfg) -> None`

Llama-shaped HyperNix causal LM. The tensor names match HF conventions

### `save_snapshot(model, out_dir, tokenizer_source=None) -> Path`

Write ``out_dir`` in HuggingFace snapshot layout.

### `load_snapshot(model_dir)`

Load any supported snapshot from ``model_dir``.

### `expand_checkpoint(src_dir, dst_dir, hidden_size=None, intermediate_size=None, num_hidden_layers=None, num_attention_heads=None, vocab_size=None, init_std=0.02, tokenizer_source=None, seed=None) -> Path`

Warm-start a bigger HyperNix model from a smaller snapshot.

### `train(model_dir, dataset_path, out_dir, steps=1000, batch_size=2, context_length=512, lr=0.0003, weight_decay=0.1, grad_clip=1.0, device=None, dtype='float32', log_every=10, save_every=500, seed=None, use_abbicus=False, use_turbo_abbicus=False, use_stml=False, untrained_max_context=8192, segment_length=512) -> Path`

Minimal causal-LM training loop.

### `init_from_scratch(out_dir, cfg, tokenizer_source=None, init_std=0.02, seed=None) -> Path`

Create a new randomly-initialized HyperNix snapshot at ``out_dir``.

